; Boot counting (#56): systemd-bless-boot runs as init_t and renames the boot entry on the ESP
; (dosfs_t) to drop its counter. Fedora's policy denies that one permission:
; avc: denied { rename } for comm="systemd-bless-b" scontext=init_t tcontext=dosfs_t tclass=file
(allow init_t dosfs_t (file (rename)))
